message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "IWAC Visualizations"
abstract: >-
  An Omeka S module that adds interactive visualizations to the Islam West
  Africa Collection (IWAC), a digital archive of francophone West African
  newspaper articles, Islamic publications, archival documents and
  audiovisual records on Islam and Muslim societies in Benin, Burkina Faso,
  Côte d'Ivoire, Niger, Nigeria and Togo. The module contributes nineteen
  page blocks and a family of resource-page blocks — corpus overviews,
  topic and semantic landscapes, entity co-occurrence networks, keyness and
  term-trend analysis, sentiment atlases, and spatial exploration — rendered
  with ECharts, MapLibre GL and d3-force over data precomputed from the
  collection's Hugging Face dataset.
